{"unit_id":"heiyouhu__dsh-themes#feature-1","repo":"heiyouhu/dsh-themes","commit":"4cd6c2cff179ae7c5bdeac9294c17a390e8143df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-themes 的功能「五套主题配色」：提供 Nord、Gruvbox、Solarized、Dracula 和 Tokyo Night，每套含浅色与深色方案。插件启动时将这些主题变体注册到 DSH theme 服务，卸载时解除注册。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/skins.ts:231-398","src/client/index.ts:112-119"]}
{"unit_id":"heiyouhu__dsh-themes#feature-2","repo":"heiyouhu/dsh-themes","commit":"4cd6c2cff179ae7c5bdeac9294c17a390e8143df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-themes 的功能「设置页主题选择」：在 Web GUI 的常规设置区域显示五套皮肤及各自的浅色、深色色块；点击色块即可将对应变体设为当前主题。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:132-144","src/client/ThemeRow.tsx:43-68"]}
{"unit_id":"heiyouhu__dsh-themes#feature-3","repo":"heiyouhu/dsh-themes","commit":"4cd6c2cff179ae7c5bdeac9294c17a390e8143df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-themes 的功能「浏览器内记住选择」：切换皮肤后将主题变体标识写入浏览器 localStorage；启动时在内置偏好允许且标识仍有效时恢复该皮肤。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:45-71","src/client/index.ts:121-130","src/client/index.ts:137-141"]}
{"unit_id":"heiyouhu__dsh-themes#feature-4","repo":"heiyouhu/dsh-themes","commit":"4cd6c2cff179ae7c5bdeac9294c17a390e8143df","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-themes 的功能「完整语义色覆盖」：每个主题变体为 DSH 多类界面角色提供颜色值，包括背景、边框、文字、按钮、状态提示、代码块、滚动条和侧边栏。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/skins.ts:19-70","src/skins.ts:169-219"]}
{"unit_id":"heiyouhu__dsh-themes#caveat-1","repo":"heiyouhu/dsh-themes","commit":"4cd6c2cff179ae7c5bdeac9294c17a390e8143df","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-themes 使用浏览器 localStorage 保存当前皮肤标识，因此选择与浏览器实例绑定；插件代码没有配置跨设备同步。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:30-43","src/client/index.ts:58-71","src/client/index.ts:121-130"]}
